sequenceDiagram
    actor Buyer as 发起用户
    participant UI as 用户界面
    participant Service as TradeService
    participant TradeDAO as TradeDAO
    participant ItemDAO as ItemDAO
    participant DB as SQLite数据库
    actor Seller as 物品所有者

    Buyer->>UI: 发起物品流转请求
    UI->>Service: createTrade(trade)
    Service->>Service: 校验物品在架且发起人不是发布者
    Service->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    Service->>TradeDAO: insert(trade)
    TradeDAO->>DB: INSERT INTO trade，状态为 PENDING
    Service->>ItemDAO: 更新物品为 RESERVED
    ItemDAO->>DB: UPDATE item
    Service->>DB: COMMIT

    Service-->>UI: 请求提交成功
    UI-->>Seller: 通知新的流转请求

    Seller->>UI: 接受流转请求
    UI->>Service: processTrade(tradeId)
    Service->>TradeDAO: 更新流转状态为 ACCEPTED
    TradeDAO->>DB: UPDATE trade
    DB-->>TradeDAO: 更新结果

    Service-->>UI: 返回处理结果
    UI-->>Buyer: 显示流转状态

    Buyer->>UI: 确认完成流转
    UI->>Service: completeTrade(tradeId)

    activate Service
    Service->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    Service->>TradeDAO: 更新交易为COMPLETED
    Service->>ItemDAO: 更新物品为COMPLETED
    Service->>DB: 更新完成时间及减排量
    Service->>DB: COMMIT
    deactivate Service

    Service-->>UI: 返回完成结果
    UI-->>Buyer: 显示流转完成
    UI-->>Seller: 显示流转完成
